                          NOTE ON GENERATED CONTENT

Parts of the character art here are produced by generative AI services through
the pipeline in crates/xtask-art. Purely AI-generated images may not be
eligible for copyright protection in some jurisdictions, including the United
States. The reservation of rights above is asserted over this directory as a
whole and over all human-authored material within it, including brand artwork,
character specifications, and the selection, arrangement, and processing of
